    Barrier" Tuner from your Deck, also you cannot Special Summon monsters for the
    rest of this turn, except WATER monsters. If you would discard, or send a card(s)
    from your hand to the GY, to activate an "Ice Barrier" monster's effect, you
    can banish this card from your GY instead of 1 of those cards.
